Note on wallpaper bundles
=========================

Each bundle under `wallpapers/` is authored by the person named in its
`manifest.json`. Copyright stays with that author. By opening a pull request
to this repository, the author agrees to publish their bundle under the MIT
License above, so that the Wallify app and its users may download, install and
redistribute it. A bundle may ship its own `LICENSE` file with different (but
MIT-compatible) terms; where present, that file governs the bundle.
